%% webular — Invocation/run lifecycle (sync + async jobs).
%% Covers crawl/research/monitor async polling and cancellation.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Parsed
    Parsed --> Rejected: invalid args
    Parsed --> Routed: valid args
    Routed --> Building: mise resolves depends chain
    Building --> Failed: build or lint error
    Building --> Running: toolchain ready
    Running --> Streaming: emit progress (SSE)
    Streaming --> Running
    Running --> Polling: async job submitted
    Polling --> Running: not done yet
    Running --> Completed: result ready
    Running --> Failed: runtime error
    Running --> Cancelled: SIGINT / AbortSignal
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    note right of Routed
      CLI never runs logic directly.
      mise owns the dependency graph.
    end note
    note right of Polling
      crawl / research / monitor
      jobs poll until terminal.
    end note
